## Capability

Cross-probe the realized contact graph against the intended schematic. Highlight an open or short down to the named contact and terminal.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Shift a component by one hole or remove the return. Locate the mismatch from the schematic, reseat the part and restore expected continuity.

